<table border="0" cellpadding="5" cellspacing="0" bgcolor="#FFFFFF" width="100%"><tr><td>
<a href="modules.php?name=News&new_topic=10"><img src="images/topics/photos.gif" border="0" Alt="Photos" align="right" hspace="10" vspace="10"></a>
<div align=justify><font class="posted" color="#000000">Sun' Bizarre column:<BR>BIZARRE snapper DAVE HOGAN knows just how Britney’s victim must be feeling today. <BR><BR>He was mown down by <B>the singer’s mentor, MADONNA.</B><BR>As Hogie looked at my Britney pictures yesterday, he said: “I know just how Calum is feeling. I had a painful experience with Madge’s stretch limo in 1986.”<BR><BR>Yes, he really has been taking showbiz pictures that long.<BR><BR>“<B>It happened at Heathrow just after Madonna had filmed Shanghai Surprise,” explains Hogie.</B><BR>“<B>She was massive. There were far too many security guards around and it started to get out of hand.</B><BR>“I got jostled, my foot ended up in the wheel arch of her limo and my foot got torn around it. It was very painful and I just lay there in agony.<BR><BR>“But there was a nice ending to the story. <B>I was offered two no-lose guarantees by leading US law firms to sue her.<BR><BR>“I decided not to and have had great access to Madonna wherever she’s gone ever since.</B><BR>“There’s a running joke between us that I’m OK because you can run me over and I won’t do anything about it.” 
</font></div>
</td></tr></table>


</td></tr></table>


