<table border="0" cellpadding="5" cellspacing="0" bgcolor="#FFFFFF" width="100%"><tr><td>
<a href="modules.php?name=News&new_topic=8"><img src="images/topics/interviste.gif" border="0" Alt="Interviews" align="right" hspace="10" vspace="10"></a>
<div align=justify><font class="posted" color="#000000"><P><IMG src="http://www.madonnavillage.it/drownedmadonna/nyc_news.jpg" align=left border=0></P>
<P>Our long time friend and <STRONG>Madonna</STRONG>'s fan &nbsp;<STRONG>Mark</STRONG> designed&nbsp;a simple<STRONG> blue T-shirt with a red line</STRONG> saying <STRONG>MadonnaSummer,</STRONG>for a store in <STRONG>San Francisco </STRONG>called<STRONG> "Body"</STRONG>.&nbsp; Surprisingly, <STRONG>Madonna</STRONG> was spotted in <STRONG>NYCity</STRONG> , two days ago,&nbsp;wearing <STRONG>Mark's T-shirt,</STRONG> while leaving a beauty salon , as you can see&nbsp; in this picture first published by <STRONG>our friend Clare</STRONG> on<A href="www.madonnalicious.com"> <STRONG>madonnalicious</STRONG></A></P>
<P>&nbsp;</P>
<P><STRONG>Mark</STRONG> was&nbsp;shocked and happy at the same time..he couldn't believe his eyes, and wrote to <STRONG>Mrs Henry</STRONG> asking for details...</P>
<P><STRONG>Mrs Henry</STRONG> replied to him by saying that "<STRONG>Someone bought it for her (Madonna)&nbsp;when we were in San Francisco and she loved it - so there you have it! &nbsp;I will pass this along!"</STRONG></P>
<P><STRONG>Now Mark wants to share with you the original artwork for the T-shirt </STRONG></P>
<P align=center><STRONG><IMG src="http://www.madonnavillage.it/drownedmadonna/ms.gif" border=0></STRONG></P>
<P><STRONG>and &nbsp;the teaser ad that ran in a local SF magazine</STRONG></P>
<P align=center><IMG src="http://www.madonnavillage.it/drownedmadonna/teaser.jpg" border=0></P>
<P>&nbsp;People from the<STRONG> Body Store</STRONG> are going to accept orders for the shirt over the phone. The number is <STRONG>415 861-6111</STRONG> The price is <STRONG>$23 plus shipping</STRONG> and the Store will ship&nbsp; it&nbsp; anywhere</P>
<P><STRONG>The Drownedmadonna Team</STRONG> congratulates with Mark, &nbsp;a fan that made his own dream come true!<BR></P>
</font></div>
</td></tr></table>


</td></tr></table>


